OL,3,CRoyal Parks issue new warning over
OL,4,Cfeeding deer in Richmond Park
OL,6,FA fresh warning has been issued
OL,7,Ftelling people not to go near the wild
OL,8,Fdeer and risk injury as new footage
OL,9,Fshowed children and adults feeding
OL,10,Fthem in a London park.
OL,12,FA Royal Parks spokesman said the
OL,13,Forganisation was "shocked" by the
OL,14,F"highly dangerous behaviour", as
OL,15,Fonline clips showed a group of people
OL,16,Fstanding in the middle of a herd of
OL,17,Fdeer and feeding them.
OL,19,FPeople should not approach the deer in
OL,20,FLondon's Richmond Park and Bushy Park,
OL,21,Fthe Royal Parks stressed.
OL,26,@uD@ROUuD@ZO]vD@AOUvD@\O]
