OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1786272502
OL,3,CRoyal Parks issue new warning over
OL,4,Cfeeding deer in Richmond Park
OL,6,FThe spokesman added: "The deer are
OL,7,Fwild animals, not pets.
OL,9,FThey are large, powerful and
OL,10,Funpredictable.
OL,12,F"A red stag can weigh up to 200kg.
OL,13,FGetting this close and offering food,
OL,14,Fputs people at real risk of serious
OL,15,Finjury."
OL,17,FPeople need to keep at least 50 metres
OL,18,Faway, according to the advice.
OL,26,@nD@VOUtD@AOUwD@HO]
