OL,3,CRoyal Parks issue new warning over
OL,4,Cfeeding deer in Richmond Park
OL,6,FFeeding the deer is "harmful to both
OL,7,Fpeople and animals", and the powerful
OL,8,Fcreatures will "approach and pester"
OL,9,Fvisitors if they associate them with
OL,10,Ffood.
OL,12,FThe organisation issued a similar
OL,13,Fwarning last month when footage shared
OL,14,Fon social media showed adults and
OL,15,Fchildren crowding around and stroking
OL,16,Fdeer in Richmond Park, south-west
OL,17,FLondon.
OL,26,@nD@UOUoD@SO]pD@POUpD@dO]
