OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1786272502
OL,3,CRoyal Parks issue new warning over
OL,4,Cfeeding deer in Richmond Park
OL,6,FThe red and fallow deer are "wild,
OL,7,Fpowerful animals", who can be quick to
OL,8,Freact and visitors should keep their
OL,9,Fdistance, Richmond Park manager Paul
OL,10,FRichards said at the time.
OL,12,FOn Friday, park users were also urged
OL,13,Fto never feed or touch the deer.
OL,15,FMembers of the public should put all
OL,16,Ffood and packaging out of sight and
OL,17,Fmove away slowly and calmly if a deer
OL,18,Fcomes towards them.
OL,26,@nD@]OUoD@QO]
